      {
        "children": [
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Consider the following reaction:"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "3t25a5i0trq33uc",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "ycv4wxotyvmwbsd",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "spv7s6gj8lmfomx",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "2\\;\\mathrm{CO}(g)\\;\\longrightarrow\\;\\mathrm C(s,\\;\\mathrm{graphite})\\;+\\;{\\mathrm{CO}}_2(g)",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "We can determine from the reaction equation that Δ"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "S"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " is negative (the number of moles of gas decreases). However, there is no obvious way to determine the sign of Δ"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "H"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ". To calculate Δ"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "H"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ", we need Δ"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "H"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "°"
                  },
                  {
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "f"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " values: "
                  }
                ],
