              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "We calculate Δ"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "H"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ":"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "g1wziz2aubouxmy",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "gjpxcs7x80g0p5d",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "dqar6awff1tm2pv",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "\\begin{array}{l}\\mathrm\\Delta H_{rxn}^{\\mathrm o}\\;=\\sum n_{\\mathrm{products}}\\mathrm\\Delta H_f^{\\mathrm o}(\\mathrm{products})\\;-\\;\\sum n_{\\mathrm{reactants}}\\mathrm\\Delta H_f^{\\mathrm o}(\\mathrm{reactants})\\\\\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;=\\;\\lbrack0\\;+\\;(-393.5\\;\\mathrm{kJ})\\rbrack\\;-\\;\\lbrack2(-110.5\\;\\mathrm{kJ})\\rbrack\\;\\\\\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;=\\;-172.5\\;\\mathrm{kJ}\\end{array}",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Knowing that Δ"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "H"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " and Δ"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "S"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " are both negative, we can say that the process is spontaneous at low (enough) temperatures. However, now we can take it one step further and calculate how low the temperature must be for the reaction to be spontaneous. Because a reaction is spontaneous if Δ"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "G"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " < 0 and not spontaneous if Δ"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "G"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " > 0, it must \"change\" from spontaneous to nonspontaneous when Δ"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "G"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " = 0. In that case:"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "5zhn9icpthnkytl",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "n33ggafwv5pimd1",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "5tjf804hr6fl021",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "\\Delta G\\;=\\;0\\;=\\;\\Delta H\\;-\\;T\\Delta S\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\Rightarrow\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;T=\\frac{\\mathrm\\Delta H}{\\mathrm\\Delta S}",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "If we know Δ"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "H"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " and Δ"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "S"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ", we can determine "
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "T"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ". We have already calculated Δ"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "H"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ". We can also calculate Δ"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "S"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " given the thermodynamic information below."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "cw861v8def04kgk",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "children": [
                          {
